{
  "$comment": [
    "What scripts/flow-app-visual-qa.mjs measures on each board, from PLAN.md's fidelity spec.",
    "A probe finds ONE element: the first `css` candidate that matches a visible element, else the smallest visible element whose whole text is `text` (or starts with it, `textStarts`), then `.closest(up)` when `up` is given.",
    "Lanes: add your component's class or data attribute to the FRONT of `css` once it exists; text finders are the fallback that works before any class does.",
    "`expect` keys: x, y, width, height, maxWidth (<=), minWidth (>=), fontSize, fontWeight, lineHeight, letterSpacing, borderRadius, paddingTop/Right/Bottom/Left, gap: numbers in px (±1, weight exact). `fontFamily~` is a substring test.",
    "`tokens` maps a computed colour property (color, backgroundColor, borderTopColor, …) to the CSS custom property it must resolve to.",
    "`copy` lists strings that must appear verbatim in the page's rendered text; `absent` lists strings that must not."
  ],
  "all": [
    { "name": "top bar", "css": ["[data-flow-topbar]", ".rl-flow-topbar", "header.rl-flow-top"], "expect": { "height": 46 }, "tokens": { "borderBottomColor": "--color-rule" } },
    { "name": "brand square", "css": ["[data-flow-brand] .rl-brand-mark", ".rl-flow-topbar .rl-brand-mark"], "expect": { "width": 16, "height": 16, "borderRadius": 4 } },
    { "name": "Tools button", "css": ["[data-flow-tools]"], "text": "Tools", "up": "button", "expect": { "fontSize": 12.5 } }
  ],
